:: Carter Repeatable Lewd Ending [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is lying there for about 5 minutes before he rolls back onto his back, looking like he just woke up from a long nap. Sort of like when your little brother is woken up for school after staying up a bit too late. <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Tired…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says, only having one eye open as he looks at you and rubs his nose with his arm. He then begins to pull on the binds, trying to silently ask you to release him before finally using his words. <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Could you… undo these?”</span> He looks spent and tired, the binds on his wrists causing the area around them to redden a bit. <span style="color:Pink">While <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> is normally all for such things, it seems his post-nut clarity had made him want to be released.</span> <br>

