<<linkreplace"Release him">>
    Deciding against messing with him, at least this time, you reach up and unlock the cuffs, allowing his hands to slip free. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> sighs in relief as he lowers his arms, sore from being held like that for so long, and gently rubs his wrists. He then takes a deep breath and just lies there for another few minutes before sitting up. <span style="color:Pink">He closes his legs and looks down shyly, his post-nut brain also getting shy once more.</span> <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Could… could you hand me my underwear?”</span> He asks nervously, pointing to his $CarterUndies.Name which sit on the ground near your feet. <span style="color:Pink">You smile and hand them to him, watching as the shy boy gets dressed and collapses into the beanbag.</span> <br>
    <br>
    After yet another few minutes, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> stretches his arms into the air and stands up. <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Dang, that makes me super tired. But I think I’m good now.”</span> He smiles, though still has some redness around his eyes, <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“So… what you wanna do now?”</span> <br>
